            <note corresp="#d24-f3" n="3" xml:id="d24-f3-content">
                <p>The attached draft text with handwritten changes is identical to the final
                    version of NSAM No. 285 (<ref target="#d25">Document 25</ref>).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d24-f4" n="4" xml:id="d24-f4-content">
                <p> Nikita S. Khrushchev.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d24-f5" n="5" xml:id="d24-f5-content">
